.TH std::cv_status 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::cv_status \- std::cv_status

.SH Synopsis
Defined in header <condition_variable>
enum class cv_status {

no_timeout,                             \fI(since C++11)\fP
timeout

};

The scoped enumeration std::cv_status describes whether a timed wait returned because of
timeout or not.

std::cv_status is used by the wait_for and wait_until member functions of
std::condition_variable and std::condition_variable_any.

.SH Member constants

Name       Explanation
no_timeout the condition variable was awakened with notify_all, notify_one, or spuriously
timeout    the condition variable was awakened by timeout expiration

